  "translation": "E ko laamɗo on yi'i — wakkatiire tedduɗo jippuɗo ummoraade kammuuli, o wi'i: “Munnee lekki ngol e mbonnee ɗum, kono reedu leɗɗe mum ɗen accere nder leydi; ɓenne ɗum e njamndi njamndaje e njamndi mboɗeeri nder ƴi'e ladde nden; dewel kammu ƴeewneto ɗum, e shareere makko wonre e dabbaaji ladde, haa wakkatiiji jeeɗiɗi ɗen yawti e makko.”",
